# MMGIS AI Agent Rules

## Database Safety
- Never use DROP DATABASE in application code. Only tests/test-db-clean.js may drop the hardcoded mmgis-test database.
- Never use DROP TABLE or TRUNCATE TABLE without authorization checks and Utils.forceAlphaNumUnder() sanitization.
- Never hardcode production database credentials in test files.
- Always use the mmgis-test database for tests. Never change the TEST_DB_NAME constant.
- Never remove NODE_ENV === 'production' safety checks in test setup files.
- When writing DB tests, always target mmgis-test and check NODE_ENV is not 'production'.
- Prefer DB_USER_TEST / DB_PASS_TEST for test credentials to enforce least-privilege role separation.
